# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/amigajuggler.xml.h:11
msgid ""
"\n"
"A real-time recreation of Eric Graham's 1987 Amiga \"Juggler\" demo: a GLSL\n"
"port of his recursive ray tracer. The robot, the balls, the checkerboard\n"
"floor and the mirror reflections are all generated and raytraced "
"procedurally.\n"
"\n"
"Written by Brian Bernstein; 2026.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Rekreácia demoverzie Erica Grahama Amiga \"Juggler\" z roku 1987: GLSL\n"
"port jeho rekurzívneho sledovača lúčov. Robot, loptičky, šachovnica\n"
"Všetky odrazy podlahy a zrkadiel sú generované a raytracované procedurálne.\n"
"\n"
"Napísal Brian Bernstein; 2026.\n"
"  "

