# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/geodesic.xml.h:20
msgid ""
"\n"
"A mesh geodesic sphere of increasing and decreasing complexity.\n"
"\n"
"A geodesic sphere is an icosohedron whose equilateral faces are\n"
"sub-divided into non-equilateral triangles to more closely approximate\n"
"a sphere.\n"
"\n"
"The animation shows the equilateral triangles subdivided into four\n"
"coplanar equilateral triangles; and then inflated outward, causing the\n"
"sub-triangles to no longer be equilateral, but to more closely\n"
"approximate the surface of a sphere.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geodesic_dome\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buckminster_Fuller\n"
"\n"
"Written by Jamie Zawinski; 2013.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Sieťová geodetická sféra s rastúcou a klesajúcou zložitosťou.\n"
"\n"
"guľa.Geodetická guľa je ikozohedrón, ktorého rovnostranné steny sú\n"
"rozdelené do nerovnostranných trojuholníkov, aby sa lepšie priblížili\n"
"\n"
"Animácia zobrazuje rovnostranné trojuholníky rozdelené na štyri\n"
"koplanárne rovnostranné trojuholníky; a potom sa nafúkla smerom von, čo "
"spôsobilo\n"
"podtrojuholníky, aby už neboli rovnostranné, ale tesnejšie\n"
"priblížiť povrch gule.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geodesic_dome\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buckminster_Fuller\n"
"\n"
"Napísal Jamie Zawinski; 2013.\n"
"  "

