"It can happen to LCD screens pretty easily, even in this modern age.\n"
"However, leaving the screen on and displaying high contrast images\n"
"can often repair the damage.  That's what this screen saver does.\n"
"\n"
"See also:\n"
"https://web.archive.org/web/20020817075924/http%3A//docs.info.apple.com/"
"article.html?artnum=88343\n"
"\n"
"Inspired by a like-named and long-defunct program by Daniel Sandler.\n"
"\n"
"Written by Jamie Zawinski; 2008.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"skôr než pekná.Opravuje vypálenie na LCD monitoroch.  Tento šetrič je "
"funkčný,\n"
"\n"
"Verte či nie, vypálenie obrazovky nie je minulosťou.\n"
"LCD obrazovkám sa to môže stať celkom ľahko aj v dnešnej modernej dobe.\n"
"Ponechanie zapnutej obrazovky a zobrazovanie obrázkov s vysokým kontrastom\n"
"môže často opraviť poškodenie.  To robí tento šetrič obrazovky.\n"
"\n"
"Pozri tiež:\n"
"https://web.archive.org/web/20020817075924/http%3A//docs.info.apple.com/"
"article.html?artnum=88343\n"
"\n"
"Inšpirovaný podobne pomenovaným a dávno neexistujúcim programom Daniela "
"Sandlera.\n"
"\n"
"Napísal Jamie Zawinski; 2008.\n"
"  "

